(rigid-body-rocket)
*title Source-driven rigid-body rocket family smoke test
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*runtime status vehicle reference-area=1.0 reference-length=1.0 inertia-x=10 inertia-y=20 inertia-z=30 dry-mass-kg=80
*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=1000 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=3600
*runtime status thermal policy=none
*runtime control throttle default=1 lower=0 upper=1

*trajectory 1 rocket start on 1
  *initial ecic x=7000000 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=1000 zdt=0 time=0 mass=100 propellant_mass=20
  *segment 1 powered
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.01
    *prop thrust=500 mdot=2
    *when time>0.2 stop
*end
